{
  "label": "Login Data",
  "category": "Personal Setting",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Tab: Login Data (Remember Me Settings)",
      "id": "login-data",
      "intro": "Tab **Login Data** digunakan untuk mengelola data login yang tersimpan di browser pengguna. Fitur ini terkait dengan opsi *Remember Me* pada halaman login — ketika diaktifkan, username pengguna disimpan secara lokal untuk kemudahan login berikutnya. Di halaman ini, pengguna dapat melihat status dan menghapus username tersimpan tersebut.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Status Remember Me & Username Tersimpan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Alert Info**: Panel biru di bagian atas menjelaskan fungsionalitas fitur *Remember Me* — bahwa username disimpan secara lokal di browser untuk kemudahan login.\n• **Card Status**: Menampilkan status Remember Me saat ini:\n  - **Badge Active** (hijau) jika username tersimpan ada dan fitur aktif\n  - **Badge Inactive** (abu) jika username tidak tersimpan atau fitur tidak diaktifkan\n  - **Border Card**: Berwarna hijau (`#22c55e`) jika Remember Me aktif, abu jika tidak aktif\n• **Saved Username**: Menampilkan username yang tersimpan dalam font monospace ukuran besar (misal: `johndoe`), atau teks *None saved* jika tidak ada.\n\n> Username yang tersimpan hanya berupa **teks username** (bukan password). Data ini aman secara teknis namun tetap dapat dihapus kapan saja sesuai preferensi pengguna.",
          "color": "#1e40af",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(30,64,175,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:14px;max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Login Data</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:12px;\">Manage your saved login information</div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"8\"/></svg><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;margin-bottom:2px;\">About Remember Me</div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#1e40af;line-height:1.5;\">When \"Remember Me\" is checked during login, your username is saved locally for convenience. You can clear this saved data at any time.</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(34,197,94,.05);border:1.5px solid #22c55e;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><div style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:#dcfce7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Remember Me Status</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Enabled</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:3px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>Active</span></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;margin:4px 0 8px;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:4px;\">Saved Username</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;font-family:monospace;\">johndoe</span></div></div><button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#fee2e2;border:none;color:#dc2626;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"3 6 5 6 21 6\"/><path d=\"M19 6l-1 14H6L5 6\"/><path d=\"M10 11v6M14 11v6\"/><path d=\"M9 6V4h6v2\"/></svg>Clear Saved Username</button></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Hapus Username Tersimpan & State Kosong",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\n• **Clear Saved Username**: Tombol merah (hanya muncul jika ada username tersimpan) untuk menghapus data username dari `localStorage`. Setelah diklik:\n  1. Data username dihapus secara instan dari browser\n  2. Tombol Clear menghilang dari tampilan\n  3. Muncul **Alert hijau** konfirmasi: *\"Saved username has been cleared...\"* selama 3 detik, lalu menghilang secara otomatis\n• **State Kosong (No Saved Username)**: Jika tidak ada username tersimpan, ditampilkan **Alert abu** dengan informasi bahwa tidak ada username yang tersimpan saat ini, serta instruksi untuk mencentang \"Remember Me\" di halaman login.\n\n> Data yang dihapus di sini tidak mempengaruhi sesi login yang sedang berjalan. Pengguna tetap dalam keadaan login.",
          "color": "#2563eb",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(30,64,175,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:14px;max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Login Data</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:12px;\">Manage your saved login information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#15803d;line-height:1.5;\"><strong>Saved username has been cleared.</strong> The next time you visit the login page, the username field will be empty.</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(100,100,100,.05);border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><div style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:#f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Remember Me Status</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Disabled</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:3px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>Inactive</span></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;margin:4px 0 8px;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:4px;\">Saved Username</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;font-family:monospace;\">None saved</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"8\"/></svg><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.5;\">No username is currently saved. Check \"Remember Me\" on the login page to have your username pre-filled next time.</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
